---
description: Route external UI, effect and template selection through the source registry
globs:
  - "**/*.tsx"
  - "**/*.jsx"
  - "**/*.blade.php"
  - "**/*.css"
  - "**/*.scss"
---

When an external UI/effect/template source is useful:
- use the approved source registry
- prefer foundation sources for application UI
- reserve highly animated sources for contexts where motion adds product value
- check project license policy before paid-source reuse
- avoid combining multiple decorative libraries unnecessarily
- normalize imported code to project tokens/components
